or quick race against random jumpers.\n\nStrap on your headset and hold on tight; you're in for a RUSH!", "short_description": "Are you ready for the ultimate thrill ride?\n\nTake a dive into the adrenaline-pumping world of wingsuit flying with RUSH! Soar down mountainsides at breakneck speeds. Weave through canyons, dodge outcrops, and plummet down sheer drops as you race towards the finish line.\n\nDo you have what it takes to walk a tightrope at near terminal velocity?\n\nStrap on your headset and hold on tight; you're in for a RUSH!"}]}, "developer_name": "The Binary Mill", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.thebinarymill.com/privacy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.thebinarymill.com/terms.php", "publisher_name": "The Binary Mill", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thebinarymill.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "RACING", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "508586240693256"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410200_1897789310254530_6549303833334382592_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=01sq--JjJnoQ7kNvwHnDnNA&_nc_oc=AdoRK3edTzM2hmth7l5wjNeCTBezZZwLjbc14IkwKoYSDA6fM1nHlqb-btVfXbCylUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGsah1fLlbuhEeemZ6Da5qAkfe4lzQc_z14qus37eRadg&oe=6A8EC744"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial